---
source: crates/rune-config/tests/config_errors.rs
description: a config exporting a promise of its scripts
expression: failure(&dir)
---
rune.config.ts: a rune config must default-export an object; this one exports a promise

rune evaluates a config to completion before any script starts, so a config that computes its scripts waits for that work itself:

  export default await buildScripts();
